3. [38;5;10m(float) fabs(r)[0m is not a call; gcc inlines [38;5;10mandps 0x7fffffff[0m. The old [38;5;10mf64[0m round trip is value-preserving but Rust doesn't guarantee NaN payloads survive a cast.[0m[0m
